00:58:18.580 --> 00:58:23.690
<v Juan Zaldivar>Anybody who wanted to leave wasn't really wanted for the revolution, and was a parasite of the revolution.

00:58:23.690 --> 00:58:55.120
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. I hope you enjoy your stay in the United States of America.

